[I] The Reliable Event Logging Protocol library

[T] librelp is a library implementing RELP, the Reliable Event Logging
[T] Protocol, which provides reliable delivery of syslog messages over the
[T] network. It is used by rsyslog.

[U] https://www.rsyslog.com

[A] Librelp Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

